# Efficiency allowlist — read by crates/marion-testsupport/tests/three_axis (run: scripts/three-axis.sh).
#
# Format: `path:item  one-line reason`. A finding not listed here fails the check; an entry nothing
# matches fails it too, so a fix deletes its line. THIS LIST ONLY SHRINKS. The perf waves are
# replacing these timer-driven waits with event-driven ones (poll(2)/kqueue, condvars, pipes);
# a bounded one-shot wait with a clear deadline may stay, and says so.

# --- tracked: efficiency waves ------------------------------------------------------------------
